{"name":"Incident with Copilot agent sessions","status":"resolved","created_at":"2026-02-27T23:18:12.408Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T18:12:15.626Z","monitoring_at":null,"resolved_at":"2026-02-27T23:49:05.426Z","impact":"minor","shortlink":"https://stspg.io/k350x50r7bt4","scheduled_for":null,"scheduled_until":null,"scheduled_remind_prior":false,"scheduled_reminded_at":null,"impact_override":"minor","scheduled_auto_in_progress":false,"scheduled_auto_completed":false,"metadata":{},"started_at":"2026-02-27T23:18:12.400Z","reminder_intervals":null,"id":"kw5jh58jh24k","page_id":"kctbh9vrtdwd","incident_updates":[{"status":"resolved","body":"On February 27, 2026, between 22:53 UTC and 23:46 UTC, the Copilot coding agent service experienced elevated errors and degraded functionality for agent sessions. Approximately 87% of attempts to start or interact with agent sessions encountered errors during this period.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis was due to an expired authentication credential for an internal service component, which prevented Copilot agent session operations from completing successfully.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe mitigated the incident by rotating the expired credential and deploying the updated configuration to production. Services began recovering within minutes of the fix being deployed.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe are working to improve automated credential rotation coverage across all Copilot service components, add proactive alerting for credentials approaching expiration, and validate configuration consistency to reduce our time to detection and mitigation of issues like this one in the future.","created_at":"2026-02-27T23:49:05.426Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-03-04T18:12:15.620Z","display_at":"2026-02-27T23:49:05.426Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"sgst0dpr8lm9","incident_id":"kw5jh58jh24k","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":[{"code":"pjmpxvq2cmr2","name":"Copilot","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"operational"}]},{"status":"investigating","body":"We have identified the cause of the elevated errors and are rolling out a fix to production. We are observing initial recovery in Copilot agent sessions.","created_at":"2026-02-27T23:45:42.678Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-02-27T23:45:42.678Z","display_at":"2026-02-27T23:45:42.678Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"xhly8tdqbxwd","incident_id":"kw5jh58jh24k","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":[{"code":"pjmpxvq2cmr2","name":"Copilot","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"partial_outage"}]},{"status":"investigating","body":"We are investigating networking issues with some requests to our models.","created_at":"2026-02-27T23:35:19.976Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-02-27T23:35:19.976Z","display_at":"2026-02-27T23:35:19.976Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"28qfjn9qnzfb","incident_id":"kw5jh58jh24k","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":[{"code":"pjmpxvq2cmr2","name":"Copilot","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"partial_outage"}]},{"status":"investigating","body":"We are investigating a spike in errors in Copilot agent sessions","created_at":"2026-02-27T23:18:36.871Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-02-27T23:18:36.871Z","display_at":"2026-02-27T23:18:36.871Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"q47rnx6tvq3b","incident_id":"kw5jh58jh24k","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":[{"code":"pjmpxvq2cmr2","name":"Copilot","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"partial_outage"}]},{"status":"investigating","body":"We are investigating reports of degraded performance for Copilot","created_at":"2026-02-27T23:18:12.496Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-02-27T23:18:12.496Z","display_at":"2026-02-27T23:18:12.496Z","deliver_notificati